        {
          "text": "Basi Elisha alikuwa ameshikwa na ugonjwa wake uliomwua; naye Yehoashi mfalme wa Israeli akatelemka amtazame, akamlilia mbele yake, akasema, Baba yangu! Baba yangu! Gari la Israeli na wapanda farasi wake! ",
